    <h1 class="title">Do Stationarity Transformations Actually Improve Time Series Forecasts? A Controlled Experimental Evaluation</h1>

    <div class="authors">
      Bhanu Suraj Malla <sup>1,*</sup><span style="color:green;">&#9432;</span> and Yuqing Hu <sup>1</sup><span style="color:green;">&#9432;</span>
    </div>

